OL,3,GNEWSACCTV released after dead birds
OL,4,Adumped at station
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew pictures have been released by
OL,7,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) as part
OL,8,Fof an inquiry into 25 to 30 birds being
OL,9,Ffound dead at a railway station.
OL,11,FThe force said the pigeons were dumped
OL,12,Fon the platform and car park at
OL,13,FChichester station in the early hours
OL,14,Fof 3 September. It is believed the
OL,15,Fbirds were killed elsewhere in Sussex.
OL,17,FThe birds were collected by a wildlife
OL,18,Fcharity and taken to a vet where X-rays
OL,19,Ffound they had been struck with ball
OL,20,Fbearings. One of the birds was a racing
OL,21,Fpigeon and the owner has been informed.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
